<i>The girl at her own…</i>

1483
01:26:35.958 --> 01:26:39.875
<i>The girl dances at her own wedding</i>

1484
01:26:40.042 --> 01:26:45.625
<i>The girl dances at her own wedding</i>

1485
01:26:46.500 --> 01:26:49.125
<i>Who does not eagerly wait for this day?</i>

1486
