1494
01:27:23.250 --> 01:27:26.792
<i>I am wearing red bangles
And a red outfit</i>

1495
01:27:26.917 --> 01:27:28.792
<i>I flutter like a peacock</i>

1496
01:27:28.875 --> 01:27:32.250
<i>The girl is totally intoxicated
By your love</i>

1497
